{"id":"wb-7-1034","name":"北二蓝氏宗祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北二蓝氏宗祠","text":"北二蓝氏宗祠位于浙江省衢州市柯城区航埠镇北二村，是浙江省境内保存最为完整的畲族宗祠。宗祠建于明崇祯年间（1628年），面积650平方米，建筑工艺精湛。2013年5月，列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%8C%E8%93%9D%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":90844236,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90844236","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c6318cc5f1a0fdd465fe8953.jpg","title":"Quzhou_Beiyu_Lanshi_Zongci_2018.07.08_17-27-49.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Quzhou_Beiyu_Lanshi_Zongci_2018.07.08_17-27-49.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/Quzhou_Beiyu_Lanshi_Zongci_2018.07.08_17-27-49.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"北淤蓝氏宗祠","width":320,"height":213}}